{"articleNo":"2918","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2918&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 대학원별 휴복학 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.08.05","hit":"9722","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"488\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"79\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">2011-2학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">휴-복학 신청 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 등록금 인상분 / 분납금 미납자는 휴․복학 신청이 불가합니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 휴&nbsp; 학(인터넷 신청) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 8. 16(화) ~ 8. 19(금) [4일간] 10:00~</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청절차 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 원스톱서비스 → 학사관리 → 학적→ 휴학신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">[군입대 및 질병휴학자 관련서류제출(24시간이내)]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력하여야 함≫ </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp; ② 휴학 확정 여부 확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">신청 및 구비서류 제출 후 익일 1시 이후 확정<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 여부 확인&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">≪조회 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적부→ 학적자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 일반휴학은 수업일수 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1/4선(2011. 9. 26)까지 만 허용됨</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 다. 인터넷으로 휴학 신청 시 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"33\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">구 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"88\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"33\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">일반휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"225\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"33\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">군입대휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"212\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"33\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">질병휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"90\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출해야할 구비<br>서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"88\" height=\"90\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출서류</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"225\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">입영통지서 또는<br>군복무확인서 사본 1부.</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"212\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">4주이상 진단서 1부.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"225\" height=\"45\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ 증빙서 하단에 학번 및&nbsp;<br>연락처&nbsp;반드시 기재</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"212\" height=\"45\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ 증빙서 하단에 학번 및<br>연락처 반드시 기재</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"52\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출기일</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">및 장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"88\" height=\"52\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출서류</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"437\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"52\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">휴학신청 후</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> 24시간 이내</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> 제출해야 됨<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">대학원지원팀(본관 302호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"134\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">유의</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">사항</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"88\" height=\"134\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"437\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"134\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">구비서류 미제출자는 3일 후 휴학신청이 자동 취소됩니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">구비서류 FAX 전송자는 도착여부 반드시 확인 바랍니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">TEL.(054)478-7015, 7018&nbsp; FAX.(054)478-7020<br>※ 군입대 휴학 후 귀향조치 또는 입영거부 학생은 즉시</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원지원팀에 신고하여야 합니다.&nbsp; </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 복&nbsp; 학(인터넷 신청)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 8. 16(화) ~ 8. 19(금) [4일간]10:00~</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶ 수강신청 및 등록금 납부만으로는 복학처리가 되지 않습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 군제대복학예정자의 전역일자가 1/4선(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 9. 26</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">) 이후일 경우에<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 는&nbsp;대학원지원팀&nbsp;☎(054)478-7015, 7018으로 문의 바람 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청절차 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">원스톱서비스 → 학사관리 → 학적</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> → 복학신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력 바람≫ </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">② 복학 확정 여부 확인 : 신청 및 구비서류 제출 후 익일 1시 이후 확정 여부 확인 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪조회 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적부→ 학적자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 복학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 9. 26</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)까지만 허용이 가능함 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">단, 등록기간(2011. 8. 23 ~ 8. 26)내에 등록금을 납부한 학생만 해당됨</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011.&nbsp; 8.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
